[{"client_msg_id":"2A057144-C69F-4209-98A9-63CA3F4ABB8D","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"一通りDML動くようにはなっているので、そろそろ着手してもいいかもですね。ただフォーマット機能がまだうまくできてないんですよね。","ts":"1617362206.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UqU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e37474b-7161-4de6-9ea5-3114262746ea","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"alter 対応、手数が多そうだけどそんなに難しく無さそう。","ts":"1617361639.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zC4N7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B4624246-B8B2-4844-9187-A3E08D05AE1F","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"そうなんです。それがで始めたあたりから急にemacserがsqlsを使い始めてます","ts":"1617361542.088700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U03C6TEAZ","UFHQ7TNT0","UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iwagl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9652639e-74c4-46bb-b7dc-b5825a22aac7","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そいや sqls の LSP Mode あるんですね。最近知りました。\n\u003chttps://emacs-lsp.github.io/lsp-mode/page/lsp-sqls/\u003e","ts":"1617360123.087400","attachments":[{"fallback":"SQL (sqls) - LSP Mode - LSP support for Emacs","id":1,"title":"SQL (sqls) - LSP Mode - LSP support for Emacs","title_link":"https://emacs-lsp.github.io/lsp-mode/page/lsp-sqls/","text":"Language Server Protocol Support for Emacs","blocks":null,"service_name":"emacs-lsp.github.io","service_icon":"https://emacs-lsp.github.io/lsp-mode/examples/logo-mini.png","from_url":"https://emacs-lsp.github.io/lsp-mode/page/lsp-sqls/","original_url":"https://emacs-lsp.github.io/lsp-mode/page/lsp-sqls/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0T9/C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67876ff5-0f90-4c2a-9f52-f5dc3ab428ec","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"ですね。DDLにはまだ対応してないです。単純に書く機会が少ないのと、各サービスごとの独自文法が更に強くなるので。","ts":"1617359057.086700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+UX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8371486f-ef5c-4300-9a49-52ec36cbbb25","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そういえば、prismaのmigrateがSQL使わざるを得ないからALTER TABLE書くためにsqls使おうと思ったんだけど、ALTER TABLEにはピンポイントで未対応っぽくて使う機会逃してしまった","ts":"1617356369.085800","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1617362766.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g/D"}]}]
